msgstr ""
"Dimulai dari klien – pahami kebutuhan klein dan berikan solusi hukum sesuai "
"kebutuhannya."

#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Stay organized by keeping track of all appointments, deadlines, and internal "
"tasks using the Calendar app. Legal assistants can easily assign meetings by "
"accessing the calendars of individual lawyers."
msgstr ""
"Tetap teratur dengan melacak semua appointment, deadline, dan task internal "
"menggunakan aplikasi Kalender. Asisten hukum dapat mudah menugaskan meeting "
"dengan mengakses kalender pengacara individu."

#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Streamline legal research and collaboration with the<strong><font "
"class=\"text-o-color-1\"> Knowledge App</font> </strong>by centralizing case "
"law, legal texts, and internal guides for efficient retrieval, "
"collaboration, and\n"
"                compliance."
msgstr ""
"Sederhanakan riset dan kolaborasi hukum dengan <strong><font class=\"text-o-"
"color-1\"> Aplikasi Pengetahuan</font> </strong>untuk memusatkan putusan "
"pengadilan, teks hukum, dan panduan internal untuk pencarian, kolaborasi, "
"dan\n"
"                kepatuhan yang efisien."

