#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The <strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">Calendar App</font></strong> "
"manages your schedule and appointments."
msgstr ""
"<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">Aplikasi Kalender</font></strong> "
"mengelola jadwal dan appointment Anda."

#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The <strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">Timesheet App</font></strong> "
"tracks billable hours and time spent."
msgstr ""
"<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">Aplikasi Timesheet</font></strong> "
"melacak jam-jam yang dapat ditagih dan waktu yang digunakan."

#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The <strong>Odoo Timesheets Assistant</strong> takes the pain out of "
"answering “What should I timesheet today?” by\n"
"            tracking work activity in the background and turning it into "
"smart, context-aware timesheet suggestions."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Odoo Timesheet Assistant</strong> membantu Anda dengan menjawab "
"pertanyaan “Apa yang harus saya catat di timesheet hari ini?” dengan\n"
"            melacak aktivitas kerja di latar belakang dan mengubahnya "
"menjadi saran timesheet yang cerdas dan sesuai konteks."

#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The AI icon is visible anywhere in Odoo, in the top-right corner of your "
"screen. Pressing it opens up your AI\n"
"            assistant that is aware of everything that's on your screen."
msgstr ""
"Ikon AI terlihat di semua tempat di Odoo, di sudut kanan atas layar Anda. "
"Jika ikonnya ditekan, asisten AI\n"
"            yang mengetahui segala sesuatu yang ada di layar Anda akan "
"terbuka."

#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The Sign App offers <strong>three levels of signatures</strong>, allowing "
"you to choose the appropriate level based on the document’s importance and "
"legal requirements."
msgstr ""
"Aplikasi Tanda Tangan menawarkan <strong>tiga level tanda tangan</strong>, "
"memberikan Anda pilihan level yang sesuai berdasarkan kepentingan dan "
"persyaratan legal dokumen."

#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The documents sent to the email alias of this project will arrive in the "
"root folder of the project. This can be\n"
"            considered as an inbox while sub folders contain treated "
"documents in an organized fashion."
msgstr ""
"Dokumen yang dikirim ke email alias project ini akan muncul di folder root "
"project. Hal ini dapat dianggap sebagai kotak masuk,\n"
"             sementara sub-folder memiliki dokumen yang diubah dengan tata "
"cara yang teratur."

#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"There are three ways AI shows up in your day-to-day work: <strong>AI "
"assistants</strong> (in-context help inside any\n"
"            app), <strong>AI agents</strong> (a custom assistant configured "
"for a specific role or task), and\n"
"            <strong>automated document handling</strong> (in the Documents "
"app)."
msgstr ""
"Ada tiga cara AI berkontribusi dalam pekerjaan sehari-hari Anda: <strong>"
"Asisten AI</strong> (bantuan dalam konteks dalam aplikasi\n"
"            mana pun), <strong>Agen AI</strong> (asisten khusus yang "
"dikonfigurasi untuk peran atau tugas tertentu), dan\n"
"           <strong> penanganan dokumen otomatis</strong> (di aplikasi "
"Dokumen)."

#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"This creates an empty document in your project to be filled by your customer "
"by uploading a file from the\n"
"                    email they receive. You could do so for all required "
"documents by the task."
msgstr ""
"Tindakan ini membuat dokumen kosong di project dapat diisi oleh pelanggan "
"dengan mengunggah file dari\n"
"                     email yang mereka terima. Anda dapat melakukannya untuk "
"semua dokumen yang diperlukan berdasarkan tugas."

#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"This ensures that appointments made outside of Odoo automatically appear in "
"the Odoo calendar."
msgstr ""
"Ini memastikan appointment yang dibuat diluar Odoo secara otomatis muncul di "
"kalender Odoo."

#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"This module provides a comprehensive suite of tools designed specifically "
"for law firms, enabling efficient management of time, appointments, "
"deadlines, cases, and client relationships. Lawyers represent their clients "
"and protect their\n"
"            interests during legal proceedings."
msgstr ""
"Modul ini menyediakan serangkaian alat komprehensif yang dirancang khusus "
"untuk firma hukum sehingga pengelolaan waktu, appointment, tenggat, kasus, "
"dan hubungan klien menjadi lebih efisien. Pengacara mewakili klien dan "
"melindungi\n"
"            kepentingan mereka selama proses hukum."

#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:product.template,description:industry_lawyer.product_product_12_product_template
msgid ""
"This product will be used to bill clients for the time spent by lawyers on "
"legal services, based on the number of hours worked as tracked through "
"<strong>Timesheets</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Produk ini akan digunakan untuk menagih klien untuk waktu yang dihabiskan "
"pengacara pada layanan hukum, berdasarkan jumlah jam yang dikerjakan sesuai "
"pelacakan melalui <strong>Timesheet</strong>."

#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model:project.tags,name:industry_lawyer.project_tags_3
msgid "Timesheet Task"
msgstr "Task Timesheet"

#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Timesheets work well but you may want to capture more on the fly some work "
"you do and expense it to the customer.\n"
"            Here is how to proceed."
msgstr ""
"Timesheet memang efektif, tetapi Anda mungkin ingin mencatat lebih banyak "
"pekerjaan yang dilakukan secara spontan dan menagihkannya kepada pelanggan.\n"
"            Berikut ini cara melakukannya."

#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model:project.task.type,name:industry_lawyer.project_task_type_1
msgid "To Do"
msgstr "Todo"

