#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.homepage
msgid "We’re seeking exceptional legal talent to join our firm"
msgstr ""
"Kami mencari talenta hukum yang kompeten untuk bergabung dengan firma kami"

#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.homepage
msgid "What you will get"
msgstr "Apa yang akan Anda dapat"

#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"When filling in the identity document expiration date, you can leverage the "
"contacts filter \"Expired IDs\" to\n"
"                    efficiently find the IDs to update!"
msgstr ""
"Saat mengisi tanggal kedaluwarsa dokumen identitas, Anda dapat memanfaatkan "
"filter kontak \"ID Kedaluwarsa\" untuk\n"
"                     menemukan ID yang perlu diperbarui dengan efisien!"

#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"When sending a message in the chatter, you can easily attach files from the "
"Documents app as attachment."
msgstr ""
"Saat mengirim pesan di chatter, Anda dapat melampirkan file dari aplikasi "
"Dokumen sebagai lampiran."

#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"When the document is available, reach the contact ID tab to fill in the "
"contact details."
msgstr ""
"Saat dokumennya tersedia, buka tab ID kontak untuk mengisi detail kontak."

#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.homepage
msgid ""
"With a client-focused approach, we offer personalized legal solutions that "
"adapt to your unique circumstances and needs."
msgstr ""
"Dengan pendekatan yang berfokus pada klien, kami menawarkan solusi hukum "
"yang dipersonalisasi dan disesuaikan dengan kondisi serta kebutuhan unik "
"Anda."

#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"With the <strong>Appointment app</strong>, you can easily schedule client "
"meetings by sharing a booking link. Clients can select a time directly from "
"your calendar that works for both of you, saving time and avoiding\n"
"                    back-and-forth communication."
msgstr ""
"Dengan <strong>aplikasi Appointment</strong>, Anda dapat menjadwalkan "
"pertemuan klien dengan mudah lewat pembagian link booking. Klien dapat "
"memilih waktu langsung dari Kalender Anda yang sesuai bagi kalian berdua "
"sehingga menghemat waktu dan menghindari\n"
"                    komunikasi bolak-balik."

#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.welcome_article_body
msgid "Would you like to discuss your Odoo setup with us or go even further?"
msgstr ""
"Apakah Anda ingin mendiskusikan lebih lanjut setup Odoo Anda dengan kami "
"atau melanjutkan tur?"

#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can access every installed App in your Odoo database on your main "
"dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Semua Aplikasi yang terpasang di database Odoo Anda bisa diakses melalui "
"dasbor utama."

#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can as well change view for the list view for example, and click the New "
"button to report some time."
msgstr ""
"Anda dapat juga mengubah tampilan untuk tampilan daftar sebagai contoh, dan "
"klik tombol Baru untuk melaporkan waktu."

#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can ask Odoo questions about your own data without writing a filter or a "
"report. From the AI app or the global\n"
"            search, type questions like:"
msgstr ""
"Anda dapat menanyai Odoo mengenai data Anda sendiri tanpa perlu menulis "
"filter atau laporan. Dari aplikasi AI atau fitur\n"
"            pencarian global, ketik pertanyaan seperti:"

#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can set up a <strong>Billing Time Target per month</strong> per employee "
"to keep track of billable hours\n"
"                    and ensure targets are met."
msgstr ""
"Anda dapat mengatur <strong>Target Waktu Penagihan per bulan</strong> per "
"karyawan untuk melacak jam kerja tertagih\n"
"                    dan memastikan target terpenuhi."

#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You completed that demo use case! There are millions of other ways to adapt "
"your Odoo setup to fit your business needs."
msgstr ""
"Anda telah berhasil menyelesaikan contoh demo kasus penggunaan ini! Ada "
"banyak cara untuk menyesuaikan pengaturan Odoo agar sesuai dengan kebutuhan "
"bisnis Anda."

#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You didn't import demo data? You can still do it. Go to Apps &gt; Industries "
"&gt; Upgrade your Law Firm package and check the <strong>\"Include Demo "
"Data\"</strong> checkbox."
msgstr ""
"Belum mengimpor data demo? Anda masih bisa melakukannya. Buka Aplikasi &gt; "
"Industri &gt; Upgrade paket Firma Hukum dan centang kotak <strong>\"Termasuk "
"Data Demo\"</strong>."

#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You should be able to execute the following flows to have an overview of "
"various flows you can quickly execute with this package using Odoo. This is "
"just an overview of the features included in this package. Feel free to "
"modify it however you want!"
msgstr ""
"Anda dapat menjalankan alur-alur berikut untuk mendapatkan gambaran umum "
"mengenai berbagai alur yang dapat dijalankan dengan cepat menggunakan paket "
"ini di Odoo. Ini hanyalah gambaran umum mengenai fitur-fitur yang disertakan "
"dalam paket ini. Silakan modifikasi sesuka hati!"

